    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "James Murphy Kinsale Property is delighted to present to the market this excellent development opportunity, a site with Full Planning Permission (No Restrictions) for a 3 Bedroom, 2 Bathroom property with an attached car garage. This 3-storey townhouse with its incorporated car garage will measure Circa 2,000 Sq.ft (185 m2) upon completion and is within minutes of walking distance of all amenities in Kinsale.\r\n\r\nAll planning conditions complied with and are ready to go.\r\n\r\nThe drawings can be downloaded from the Cork County Council using the planning permission number, which is 21/05301. Further details available from sole agents office."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent Development Opportunity. Circa 2,000 Sq.ft (185 m2)\r\n3 Bedroom and 2 Bathroom property with an attached car garage\r\nWithin minutes of walking distance of all amenities in Kinsale\r\nSite Size: Circa 57.4m2 (0.0141 Acres)\r\nAll planning conditions have been complied with and it is ready to go.\r\nSite For Sale with Full Planning Permission for a 3-storey townhouse\r\nPrice: AMV $325,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Disclaimer/Privacy Policy\r\nJames Murphy and Co Auctioneers and Valuers act as agents for the vendors or lessors of this property whose agents they are, give notice that: 1. By sending an enquiry through the property portal in relation to any of our property listings, you are consenting to the storage, use and processing of your personal data by the provider according to James Murphy Co Auctioneers and Valuers privacy policy in order for us to reply to your contact request or request for information. A copy of our privacy policy can be viewed at http://www.kinsaleproperty.ie/privacy-policy/ You can revoke your consent at any time in the future in line with the privacy policy. 2. The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not institute, nor constitute part of, an offer or contract. 3. All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation and any other details are given in good faith. They are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representatives of fact. Still, they must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. 4. Any loose furniture, non-integrated appliances, white goods and curtains are deemed not to be included in the sale of the property unless specifically agreed between the parties and outlined in an inventory. 5. No person in the employment of James Murphy and Co Auctioneers and Valuers has any authority to make or give representation or warranty in relation to this property. 6. Availability upon agreement - subject to contract. This offer is subject to change of price, withdrawal or prior sale without notice. 7. Transfer fees, i.e. stamp duty, solicitor fees etc, are not included in the sales price and have to be paid by the buyer. The seller will pay the commission."
      }
